OL,3,GNEWSAFarmer who says 999 call foiled
OL,4,ARAF Fairford plot only has 'partial
OL,5,Apicture', defence secretary tells BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FGloucestershire Police say they were
OL,8,Falerted at about 00:45 on Sunday. Five
OL,9,Fmen remain in custody - they were
OL,10,Farrested under the Explosives Act and
OL,11,Fon suspicion of preparing a terrorist
OL,12,Fact
OL,14,FThe RAF base is used by the US
OL,15,Fmilitary. President Trump says the US
OL,16,Fhad the five men "under view for a long
OL,17,Ftime, and we got them"
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
